; THE HIDDEN REALM'S GEOGRAPHY RECIPE (finish plan, Act II).
;
; A preserved country, not a wild one: broad, low, still ground for fields and canals, almost no
; mountain, very gentle local relief, and hydrology held back so the generator does not cut living
; rivers through a land where nothing moves. The canals are authored water in the spec.
;
; MasterSeed is the one world seed, shared with every realm; the band gives it different ground.

